{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014LatExW1FYpM4qR2vyBvDH","type":"tool_result","content":"# 2026-04-14-1200-bulk-alloc-mle-fold-buffers\n\nReplace per-matrix GPU buffer allocation in MLE sumcheck fold rounds with bulk pre-allocated arena buffers. Currently, each MLE round allocates ~2000 individual DeviceBuffers for fold output matrices (one per trace matrix for both mat_evals and sels), totaling ~40K cudaMallocAsync/cudaFreeAsync calls across ~20 rounds. This per-round allocation overhead causes MLE Rounds to reverse-scale at APC 300 (173ms vs 114ms at APC 0 despite 2x less work), contributing ~59ms of pure CUDA memory API overhead on the main thread. By allocating a single contiguous buffer per fold group per round, we reduce 40K allocations to ~40, eliminating the per-matrix allocation/free overhead and improving memory pool behavior for subsequent phases.\n---\n# Plan: Bulk-Allocate MLE Fold Output Buffers\n\n## Goal\n---\n278 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-14-1200-bulk-alloc-mle-fold-buffers/plan.md","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a8941d98-8943-40ba-ba2b-e8ee56c821e0","uuid":"53b0a327-4687-4a67-ad78-d0afd2d30d49","timestamp":"2026-04-14T10:23:17.218Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# 2026-04-14-1200-bulk-alloc-mle-fold-buffers\n\nReplace per-matrix GPU buffer allocation in MLE sumcheck fold rounds with bulk pre-allocated arena buffers. Currently, each MLE round allocates ~2000 individual DeviceBuffers for fold output matrices (one per trace matrix for both mat_evals and sels), totaling ~40K cudaMallocAsync/cudaFreeAsync calls across ~20 rounds. This per-round allocation overhead causes MLE Rounds to reverse-scale at APC 300 (173ms vs 114ms at APC 0 despite 2x less work), contributing ~59ms of pure CUDA memory API overhead on the main thread. By allocating a single contiguous buffer per fold group per round, we reduce 40K allocations to ~40, eliminating the per-matrix allocation/free overhead and improving memory pool behavior for subsequent phases.\n---\n# Plan: Bulk-Allocate MLE Fold Output Buffers\n\n## Goal\n---\n278 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-14-1200-bulk-alloc-mle-fold-buffers/plan.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
