{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018oDBsVYRgRn1ub9QLrcgd6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All tasks complete. Here's the session summary:\n\n## Session Summary\n\n**Current Performance (APC 300):**\n- STARK excl trace: 1322ms (1.86x vs baseline 2455ms)\n- Target: <1064ms (2x of APC 0's 2127ms)\n\n**Bottleneck Identified:** MLE Rounds reverse-scaling (173ms at APC 300 vs 114ms at APC 0) caused by ~37K per-round `cudaMallocAsync`/`cudaFreeAsync` calls in `fold_mle_evals`. Nsight confirms 47K main-thread allocs (38ms) + 49K frees (21ms) = 59ms of pure CUDA memory API overhead.\n\n**Selected Optimization:** `2026-04-14-1200-bulk-alloc-mle-fold-buffers`\n- Replace per-matrix fold output allocations with single bulk arena allocation per fold group per round\n- New `ArenaMatrix<T>` (non-owning, Copy) + `MatrixRef<T>` enum (Owned/Arena transition) + `FoldArena<T>` (lifetime management)\n- Reduces ~37K allocs to ~200 across 20 MLE rounds\n- Expected saving: 40–55ms at APC 300\n\n**Review:** Two rounds of subagent review. All design-level findings addressed. Final assessment: **prototype-ready, no design-level blockers**.\n\n**Files created:**\n- `autoopt-results/task.md` — task description\n- `autoopt-results/2026-04-14-1200-bulk-alloc-mle-fold-buffers/plan.md` — reviewed implementation plan (278 lines)\n\n**No source code was modified.**"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_read_input_tokens":178446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":397},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a8941d98-8943-40ba-ba2b-e8ee56c821e0","uuid":"be675264-a512-4c4e-8272-509afca89150"}
